        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Flula Borg, Dirk Nowitzki, Alex Simmons, David Giuntoli\n- Works: Buddymoon, Honey Buddies\n- Organizations: Dallas Mavericks, National Basketball Association\n- Roles: actor, comedian, musician, YouTube personality, professional basketball player, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Dirk Werner Nowitzki was born on June 19, 1978, and is a German professional basketball player for the Dallas Mavericks of the National Basketball Association.\n- Flula Borg was born on March 28, 1982, and is a German actor, comedian, musician, and YouTube personality better known as DJ Flula or simply Flula.\n- Flula Borg's name is sometimes stylized as f|u|a.\n- Buddymoon, previously known as Honey Buddies, is a 2016 American independent comedy film.\n- Alex Simmons directed Buddymoon.\n- Alex Simmons, Flula Borg, and David Giuntoli wrote Buddymoon.\n- Flula Borg and David Giuntoli starred in Buddymoon.",
